<title>USA: VocalTec Ltd Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>VocalTec Ltd Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>All data in thousands except per-share and share data</p>
<p>				3	    3	    9	    9</p>
<p>			    months     months     months     months</p>
<p>			    ended	ended	ended	ended</p>
<p>			   Sep 30,    Sep 30,    Sep 30,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>				1996	1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		 2,369	  683	 5483	1,495</p>
<p> Net loss		  2,021	  415	4,806	  865</p>
<p> Net loss per share     0.23	 0.07	 0.59	 0.14</p>
<p>Weighted average no. of shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 8,613,000  6,015,000  8,181,000  6,053,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Results from first nine months of 1996 includes a one-time charge of $1.29 million related to acquired, in-process research and development.</p>
<p>Company is based in Herzliya, Israel.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610</p>
